# Jacob’s brand

Jacob Tindall’s site is about **marine mammal conservation** (especially dolphins and manatees) and **music** (piano and composition).

## Do

- Keep the ocean + music visual system (navy, seafoam, sand) in `src/styles/global.css`
- Put conservation notes in `src/content/conservation/` and music notes in `src/content/music/`
- Mark starter copy clearly so Jacob can replace it
- Check conservation facts or say they are unverified — do not invent science, injury counts, or organization quotes

## Do not

- Copy Elyse’s theatre, lessons, casting, resume, or Broadway framing
- Lead with age or “teen influencer” copy
- Add professional booking, paid lessons, or casting materials
- Treat games as the main brand (they are spare-time hobbies only)
